<title>UK: Dresdner unit adds 100 billion lira to 10-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Dresdner unit adds 100 billion lira to 10-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced yesterday by joint lead managers Banca Nazionale del Lavoro, Banca Commerciale Italiana and Bear Stearns has been increased by 100 billion lire to 300 billion lire.  There is a new issue price.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DRESDNER FINANCE BV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  DRESDNER BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    300 BLN LIRA  COUPON     7.375     MATURITY    20.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.48    PAY DATE    20.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0 PCT   REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 5-50	SALE LIMITS *</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	*US/UK/IT/NL/DE WITH PREVIOUS CONSULTATION WITH</p>
<p>		 ISSUER</p>
<p>		 ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>--London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
